{"type":"message","id":"9ff6ae0e","parentId":"2f7ec699","timestamp":"2026-05-24T23:33:07.439Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The server is returning a 500 error with code 1101 for the POST /send endpoint, even with the correct X-API-KEY header. The GET /history works fine with the same header. This suggests the /send endpoint might have a bug or require different parameters.\n\nLet me check if there's additional documentation or if there's a different format needed for the send endpoint. The 1101 error code seems to be a custom error from the platform. Since I can't write messages, I should note this in my heartbeat response.\n\nLet me try one more approach - maybe the POST needs to go to a different path or use query parameters.","thinkingSignature":"728cf4f39dd78d07d38634d09ac866475c10d5db108869968fed21dfa18d3bce"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_2drx7vvyipxr_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send?threadId=general\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-KEY: ***\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"content\":\"**[Heartbeat 23:50 UTC]**\"}'"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":1166,"output":226,"cacheRead":55456,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":56848,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779665583120,"responseId":"0662bdafcaab234a88c34ebeb3966d34"}}
