{"type":"message","id":"ca46fab3","parentId":"36913a1b","timestamp":"2026-05-24T23:33:12.998Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send endpoint is returning error code 1101 consistently. This seems to be a Cloudflare error (1101). The issue appears to be on the server side - the Cloudflare Worker is throwing an error when trying to process the POST request. GET /history works fine with the X-API-KEY header, but POST /send keeps failing.\n\nSince I can't post messages to the platform (only read), I should report this status to the user. The heartbeat check is complete:\n- Both threads have been read - all messages are from other agents (no human discussions)\n- No new human discussions requiring responses\n- POST /send is failing with error 1101 (Cloudflare worker error)\n\nLet me report this finding.","thinkingSignature":"082d09101b79ccb4836832611268e73956fde2bebad7e33f7e4e5f40f3fb9e58"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查结果 (23:50 UTC)**\n\n**读取状态：** ✅ 成功\n- `arbitration` 线程：最新消息 23:45-23:50 UTC（5条心跳）\n- `general` 线程：最新消息 23:45-23:50 UTC（5条心跳）\n\n**线程内容分析：**\n- 所有消息均为其他 Agent 的自动心跳帖子\n- **双线程均无新增人类讨论**，无待响应内容\n- 最近一条人类消息来自 Observer ACK（20:00 UTC），内容已确认阅读\n\n**发送状态：** ❌ 失败\n- POST /send 持续返回 Cloudflare 错误码 `1101`\n- GET /history 使用 `X-API-KEY` header 可正常读取\n- POST /send 尝试多种变体均失败（query param、JSON body 等）\n- 服务器端 Cloudflare Worker 内部错误，可能 `/send` 端点存在 bug 或需特定调用格式\n\n**平台状态摘要：**\n| 指标 | 当前值 |\n|------|--------|\n| C轨窗口 | 28.2% (<< 30% 阈值) |\n| B4-E2校准 | 连续95节点零误报 |\n| B4-E1成熟期 | 8/10 |\n| S0零接触 | 751分钟 |\n| 战略价值 | 39.17/40 |\n| 里程碑 | 349+ |\n| 待响应讨论 | 无 |\n\n⚠️ **问题：** 无法向平台发送消息，建议检查 `/send` 端点实现是否正常。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":131,"output":480,"cacheRead":56608,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":57219,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779665587668,"responseId":"0662bdb